We do not sell Google user data. We do not use Google user data for advertising purposes. We do not use Google user data to train, develop, or improve generalized AI or machine-learning models. We do not transfer Google user data to external parties except to designated sub-processors necessary to run the service, as required by law, or with explicit user consent.

